   <title>Measles in America: Here&#039;s a constructive approach to beating the disease, based on Brazil&#039;s experience</title>
   <link>https://www.dw.com/en/measles-in-america-here-s-a-constructive-approach-to-beating-the-disease-based-on-brazil-s-experience/a-79990626?maca=en-rss_en_science-22531-xml-mrss</link>
   <description>The US is now officially a measles contagion zone. By mid-2026, there were more infections than in all of the previous year. But the country could beat measles again, just like Brazil did two years ago.</description>
